{
  "fixture": "chart-panel",
  "version": 1,
  "encoding": {
    "models": "buildChartPanelModel(input) (WP11 1.1): the root page's sections in order, each with its semantic id, its English title (empty for a section without a header) and its rows in order (semantic id and English label; `disabled` when shown but not actionable). `chartType` is a ChartTypePB name, `xType`/`yType` FieldType names (null: no property; for Y that is Count all), `aggregation` the stored aggregation_type. WP12: `groupBy` (absent: false) is whether the chart has an effective Group by; it shows the Group style row of bar and horizontal bar charts.",
    "writes": "chartPatchFor(action, current) (WP11 1.13): the persisted keys one panel action writes in one transaction, null meaning clear to default. `current` holds the stored keys the patch reads (x_sort, aggregation_type). `fieldType` is a FieldType name. WP12: `group_by` picks a Group by property (`\"\"` is None), `group_by_date` picks a date grouping of the Group by date property `field`, `group_style` picks a group style; `current.group_by_field_id` is the stored Group by.",
    "rowIcons": "The logical icon of each row id, the same on both clients."
  },
  "rowIcons": {
    "x_what": "alt_arrow_up",
    "y_what": "alt_arrow_up",
    "x_date_grouping": "calendar",
    "x_text_grouping": "text",
    "x_buckets": "number",
